## 6. 📂 File se DataFrame Load Karna

### CSV se:
```python
df = pd.read_csv('dataset.csv')
df = pd.read_csv('dataset.csv', index_col=0)  # pehla column index banega
```

> **Slide 12 image:** Excel mein jo data tha wahi CSV mein tha — pandas ne uss CSV ko read karke DataFrame bana diya ✅

### JSON se:
```python
df = pd.read_json('dataset.json')
```

> **Slide 15 image (JSON Example 1):** JSON mein column-first format tha → Ahmad, Ali, Rashed keys nested the "apples" aur "oranges" andar
>
> **Slide 16 image (JSON Example 2):** JSON mein row-first format tha → har person ka apna object tha

### SQL se:
```python
import sqlite3
con = sqlite3.connect("database.db")
df = pd.read_sql_query("SELECT * FROM purchases", con)
df = df.set_index('index')   # kisi bhi column ko index banao
```

