## 8. 🔍 Data Dekhna aur Samajhna — Important Methods

### `.head()` aur `.tail()`
```python
movies_df.head()      # pehle 5 rows
movies_df.head(10)    # pehle 10 rows
movies_df.tail(2)     # aakhri 2 rows
```

### `.info()`
```python
movies_df.info()
# Batata hai: rows/columns count, null values, data types, memory usage
```

### `.shape`
```python
movies_df.shape    # (1000, 12) — 1000 rows, 12 columns
```

### `.describe()`
```python
movies_df.describe()           # Numerical columns ka stats (mean, min, max, std)
movies_df['genre'].describe()  # Categorical column ka stats (unique, top, freq)
```

