## 15. 🏷️ Categorical Data

Jab column mein limited/repetitive values hon (jaise gender, country):
```python
cat = pd.Categorical(['a', 'b', 'c', 'a', 'b', 'c'])

# Custom categories ke saath
cat = pd.Categorical(["a", "c", "c", np.nan], categories=["b", "a", "c"])
```

**Kab use karo:**
- String column mein sirf kuch hi different values hon → memory bachti hai
- Logical order chahiye sorting mein (jaise "one" < "two" < "three")

